For three candidate GLM responses, evaluate mean, variance, variance function V(μ), and scale φ where relevant:
(1) Poisson with λ = 3;
(2) Binomial(n = 20, p = 0.4);
(3) Gamma with mean μ = 8 and shape α = 2.

